# Shipped terrain bakes are large (10s–100s of MB per body) and binary —
# tracked via Git LFS so the repo stays cloneable.
#
# Setup once per clone: `git lfs install`
# Produced by: `just bake <body>` (writes `assets/baked/<body>.bin`)
# Consumed by: the game's startup loader. Missing or stale bakes are fatal
# on launch (procedural bodies) — see `crates/game/src/rendering/spawn.rs`.
assets/baked/*.bin filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
